WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.024
Unit six. Safety Rules!

2
00:00:03.975 --> 00:00:07.540
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.913
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:14.415
Today we learn about Safety Rules. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.472 --> 00:00:19.255
Seatbelt. Say it with me. Seatbelt!

6
00:00:22.758 --> 00:00:26.224
Fire. Say it with me. Fire!

7
00:00:29.724 --> 00:00:33.240
Exit. Say it with me. Exit!

8
00:00:36.751 --> 00:00:40.784
Emergency. Say it with me. Emergency!

9
00:00:44.282 --> 00:00:47.649
Helmet. Say it with me. Helmet!

10
00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:54.551
Stranger. Say it with me. Stranger!

11
00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:01.241
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

12
00:01:04.751 --> 00:01:07.935
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

13
00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:20.706
I always wear my seatbelt in the car. I know where the exit is in case of a fire or emergency. I stay safe around a stranger and only trust adults I know well.

14
00:01:20.755 --> 00:01:21.939
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.185 --> 00:01:28.535
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.585 --> 00:01:29.735
Exit!

17
00:01:30.539 --> 00:01:35.770
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:36.970
Safe!

19
00:01:37.739 --> 00:01:44.986
Did you know? Practicing a fire drill helps everyone stay calm and safe during a real emergency!

20
00:01:45.036 --> 00:01:47.067
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:55.352
Think and answer. What would you do in an emergency?

22
00:01:55.402 --> 00:01:56.552
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.679 --> 00:02:02.594
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.644 --> 00:02:05.295
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

